{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"他再心动，也【不愿只凭这点指望】回去忍让；明知回去未必找得回那份亲近，还是忍不住想：万一能呢？\",\"source\":\"S11-1：明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近，他却还是忍不住想：万一能呢？S11-2：他再心动，也不愿只凭这点指望，就回去过从前那种忍让的日子。\",\"type\":7,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"屏幕稿先呈现不愿凭希望回去的克制，再呈现忍不住期待的念头，颠倒了定稿中先产生期待、再作出克制的顺序。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "18bf76e2-2c57-4e29-b331-86487dd832e9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T022411509898Z", "elapsed_seconds": 113.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T02:26:04.893584+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b28235b5ba508746201a749c653c07e1b06e1fd6beac5a9394060f3a43356955", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual